Validate a receipt file can be parsed (developer tool)

Usage: cockpitctl validate [OPTIONS] --input <INPUT>

Options:
      --input <INPUT>  Path to a JSON receipt or cockpit report
      --strict         Perform strict JSON Schema validation (default)
      --lax            Skip JSON Schema validation; only parse as JSON
  -h, --help           Print help
